# Git and version control
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It is not a build artifact: it is
# the pinned resolution of every dependency, and the Dockerfile copies it so
# the image builds the versions this repository was tested with. Excluding it
# broke the build outright — `COPY Cargo.lock` cannot copy a file the context
# does not contain — which is how both Dockerfiles came to be unbuildable
# without anyone noticing.

